side_effects: "Terrible day vision (40 ft / 12 m), and eyes so sensitive to light that some sort of tinted protective covering must be worn over them; blinded by bright sunlight, flashbulbs and other bright lights. Psionic attacks that use bio-manipulation or empathic transmission do double damage to a Psi-X and last twice as long. Ley lines increase the psychic''s powers as usual, but also heighten confidence, aggression and the other base emotions. Insanity: randomly roll or determine three phobias and one obsession. Tires easily (one third the endurance of a normal human), and is prone to substance abuse and easily addicted to alcohol and drugs."
